DPP IV ChimeraX commands

Strip the water and the main drug:
delete solvent
delete :2VH

Delete the sugars (NAG) and the Sodium (NA):
delete :NAG
delete :NA

Add your geometric hydrogens:
addh

Save it immediately (Do not run addcharge):
save ~/DPP4_clean.pdb

Format change + adding charges + choosing A conformation
mk_prepare_receptor.py -i ~/DPP4_clean.pdb -o ~/DPP4_prepared.pdbqt -p --allow_bad_res --default_altloc A

